{
  "esm": "2.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "TGradPhotolysis",
    "description": "Non-autonomous per-cell photochemistry on 4 cells (the wrt = time golden fixture, esm-jacobian-spec.md \u00a74.2): a photolysis rate j(t) = j0 max(0, cos(omega t + 0.3 i)) read through an array observed, a scalar emission observed through the esm:std linear template of t scaled by a piecewise-constant esm:std hour(t) factor, a diurnal esm:std julian_day(t) source, and one autonomous row (S)."
  },
